  {
   "uuid": "fcfa0140-7d88-452f-aac4-668cd65c4053",
   "slug": "aither",
   "name": "Aither",
   "class_name": "QDRV_RSI_S02_Aither_SCItem",
   "classification": "Ship.QuantumDrive",
   "classification_label": "Quantum Drive",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "Named for an ancient god of light and the heavens, the Aither quantum drive honors its namesake as it ferries people places their ancestors could never imagine. This classic RSI medium-sized component has graced civilian ships for centuries.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: RSI\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S2\nG\u00fctegrad: B\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nBenannt nach einem antiken Gott des Lichts und des Himmels, ehrt der Aither-Quantenantrieb seinen Namensvetter, w\u00e4hrend er die Menschen an Orte bringt, die ihre Vorfahren sich nie h\u00e4tten vorstellen k\u00f6nnen. Diese klassische mittelgro\u00dfe Komponente von RSI schm\u00fcckt zivilen Schiffen seit Jahrhunderten.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1aRSI\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a2\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1aB\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u4ee5\u53e4\u8001\u7684\u5149\u660e\u4e4b\u795e\u548c\u5929\u5802\u4e4b\u540d\u547d\u540d\uff0c\u4ee5\u592a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u4ee5\u5176\u540d\u5b57\u800c\u8457\u79f0\uff0c\u56e0\u4e3a\u5b83\u53ef\u4ee5\u8fd0\u9001\u4eba\u4eec\u5230\u524d\u4eba\u65e0\u6cd5\u60f3\u5230\u7684\u4f4d\u7f6e\u3002\u8fd9\u4e2a\u7ecf\u5178\u7684RSI\u4e2d\u578b\u7ec4\u4ef6\u5df2\u7ecf\u52a0\u88c5\u5728\u6c11\u7528\u8230\u8247\u4e2d\u591a\u4e2a\u4e16\u7eaa\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Propulseur quantique\nFabricant : RSI\nTaille : 2\nQualit\u00e9 : B \nClasse : Civile\n\nNomm\u00e9 d'apr\u00e8s un ancien dieu de la lumi\u00e8re et des cieux, le propulseur quantique Aither rend hommage \u00e0 son homonyme alors qu'il transporte des personnes vers des lieux que leurs anc\u00eatres n'auraient jamais pu imaginer. Ce composant RSI de taille moyenne classique a orn\u00e9 les vaisseaux civils pendant des si\u00e8cles."
   },
