  {
   "uuid": "70163f66-522d-4161-824e-18eb08299258",
   "slug": "allegro",
   "name": "Allegro",
   "class_name": "QDRV_ORIG_S04_890J_SCItem",
   "classification": "Ship.QuantumDrive",
   "classification_label": "Quantum Drive",
   "description": {
    "en_EN": "Designed specifically for the 890 Jump, the Allegro quantum drive blends ArcCorp's expertise with Origin's exceptionally high standards, making it the ideal companion for a luxury cruise through the stars.",
    "de_DE": "Hersteller: ArcCorp\nTyp (En): Quantum Drive\nTyp (De): Quantenantrieb\n\nGr\u00f6\u00dfe: S4\nG\u00fctegrad: Individuell angefertigt\nKlasse: Civilian (Zivil)\n\nSpeziell f\u00fcr die 890 Jump entwickelt, kombiniert der Allegro-Quantenantrieb ArcCorps Fachkenntnisse mit Origins au\u00dfergew\u00f6hnlich hohen Standards und macht ihn zum idealen Begleiter f\u00fcr eine Luxuskreuzfahrt durch die Sterne.",
    "zh_CN": "\u7269\u54c1\u7c7b\u578b\uff1a\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\n\u5236\u9020\u5546\uff1a\u5f27\u5149\u96c6\u56e2 (ArcCorp)\n\u5c3a\u5bf8\uff1a4\n\u7b49\u7ea7\uff1a\u91cf\u8eab\u5b9a\u5236\n\u5206\u7c7b\uff1a\u6c11\u7528\n\n\u7279\u522b\u4e3a890\u8dc3\u52a8\u800c\u8bbe\u8ba1\uff0c\u6781\u901f\u91cf\u5b50\u9a71\u52a8\u5668\u7ed3\u5408\u4e86\u5f27\u5149\u96c6\u56e2\u7684\u4e13\u4e1a\u77e5\u8bc6\u548c\u8d77\u6e90\u7684\u6781\u7aef\u9ad8\u6807\u51c6\uff0c\u4f7f\u5b83\u6210\u4e3a\u60a8\u6f2b\u6b65\u661f\u8fb0\u4e4b\u95f4\u7684\u7406\u60f3\u966a\u4f34\u3002",
    "fr_FR": "Type d'article : Moteur quantique\nFabricant : ArcCorp\nTaille : 4\nQualit\u00e9 : Sus mesure\nClasse : Civile\n\nCon\u00e7u sp\u00e9cifiquement pour le 890 Jump, le moteur quantique Allegro allie l'expertise d'ArcCorp aux normes d'excellence d'Origin, faisant de lui le compagnon id\u00e9al pour une croisi\u00e8re luxueuse \u00e0 travers les \u00e9toiles."
   },
